pdns (5.1.3-1.devuan5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Custom build for Devuan 5 daedalus (no-ip.pl NS upgrade, 4.7.3 -> 5.1.3).
  * Removed systemd/libsystemd-dev Build-Depends and --enable-systemd
    configure flag: Devuan has no systemd, pdns-server on ns1/ns2 is
    started via a hand-maintained /etc/init.d/pdns script instead.

